MODULE 4 — INTERNATIONAL PAYMENT INTELLIGENCE

Integrate PayPal Sandbox.

Build the payment architecture with:

- Payment order creation.
- Buyer payment initiation.
- Sandbox checkout.
- Payment approval.
- Server-side capture.
- Transaction verification.
- Payment history.
