12. REAL BUSINESS WORKFLOWS

Implement end-to-end workflows rather than isolated screens.

WORKFLOW A — NEW EXPORT ORDER

Create order → Add buyer → Add products → Enter pricing → Validate → Save → Create Digital Twin.

WORKFLOW B — DOCUMENT PROCESSING

Upload document → AI extraction → Review → Correct → Validate → Associate with order → Update document readiness.

WORKFLOW C — FINANCIAL ANALYSIS

Open order → Retrieve costs → Calculate profitability → Identify missing expenses → Generate AI explanation.

WORKFLOW D — INTERNATIONAL PAYMENT

Select eligible order → Create PayPal Sandbox payment → Buyer approval → Backend capture → Verify transaction → Update payment status.

WORKFLOW E — EXPORT COMPLETION

Confirm order → Complete documents → Confirm payment conditions → Update shipment → Record delivery → Complete order.

Each workflow must have proper validation, success states, error states and recovery options.

